  "ingredients": [
    "1/4 cup olive oil",
    "3 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1 medium lemon (juice + zest)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1 teaspoon turmeric powder",
    "3/4 medium yellow onion (wedges)",
    "28 ounce boneless, skinless chicken thighs",
    "3/4 cup full-fat plain greek yogurt",
    "4 ounce cucumber",
    "2 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "2 tablespoon coconut oil",
    "16 ounce cauliflower (riced)",
    "3/4 cup water",
    "1 teaspoon turmeric powder",
    "1 teaspoon zaatar",
    "8 ounce fresh tomatoes",
    "2 tablespoon fresh parsley (chopped)",
    "1 medium lemon (slices)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-middle-eastern-skewers-with-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-54115-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Middle-Eastern-Skewers-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, mix together the marinade ingredients: olive oil, lemon juice and zest, minced garlic, salt and pepper, and turmeric.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-middle-eastern-skewers-with-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-54115-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Middle-Eastern-Skewers-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In another bowl, lay out the chicken and onion wedges. Completely cover them in the marinade. Cover and let sit in the refrigerator for a minimum of 10 minutes and a maximum of overnight.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-middle-eastern-skewers-with-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-54115-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Middle-Eastern-Skewers-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, mix together the ingredients for the sauce: greek yogurt, chopped cucumbers, and minced garlic. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-middle-eastern-skewers-with-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-54115-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Middle-Eastern-Skewers-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare the skewers by sliding on the chicken pieces and alternating with the onion wedges. Put all of the tomatoes on one skewer.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-middle-eastern-skewers-with-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-54115-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Middle-Eastern-Skewers-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add the coconut oil, cauliflower rice, water, turmeric powder, and zaatar. Keep on medium heat for about 5-10 minutes until the water has evaporated.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-middle-eastern-skewers-with-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-54115-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Middle-Eastern-Skewers-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the grill on medium heat. Grease the grill with a little bit of oil. Cook for 15-20 minutes, turning about every 5 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-middle-eastern-skewers-with-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-54115-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Middle-Eastern-Skewers-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the skewers with the turmeric cauliflower rice and garlic sauce. Serve with lemon slices and chopped parsley. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-middle-eastern-skewers-with-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-54115-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
